              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Crew of two to five men armed with swords. May have light armour (+2 pts per crewman). Stone thrower: Range 48", Strength 7, no save, D3 wounds per hit. No more than one artillery piece per Skutatoi unit in the army (not enforced). One artillery piece per 500 points. (Armies of Antiquity p.29)</characteristic>
